Changelog: 17-10-2026 12:45:18

Release 0.3.1.

Changelog: 17-10-2026 12:35:30

Fixed. The app's folder in the suite is apps/pcsx2 (was apps/pcsx2-manager) and its package is pcsx2_manager (was
bc250_pcsx2_manager): the suite's naming convention (owner, 17-10-2026), a short folder name and the package named
after the app without the BC-250 prefix; both names are the owner's. With the folder go its key in the portal, its
chapter of the wiki (apps/pcsx2/, which the Manual link opens), its installer test and its release tags:
pcsx2-v<x.y.z> from the next release on, which the app's update check follows. The installed app keeps its name,
its launcher bc250-pcsx2-manager, the run wrapper bc250-pcsx2-run that the Steam shortcuts start, its folder under
~/.local/share with the installed PCSX2, and its settings; the portal moves its record of the installed copy to the
new key.

